# KDE Plasma on Wayland (ADR-0002). kwin-wayland is the compositor; xwayland
# keeps legacy X11 applications working. sddm is included for the installed
# system; note that Debian trixie's sddm is still described as an X11 display
# manager and pulls xserver-xorg -- Wayland session behaviour must be boot-tested.
plasma-desktop
plasma-workspace
kwin-wayland
xwayland
sddm
breeze
systemsettings
kde-cli-tools
polkit-kde-agent-1
# kreadconfig6 is used by the clean-account theme validation in the QEMU
# boot harness (verified: /usr/bin/kreadconfig6 in trixie).
libkf6config-bin

# A minimal usable desktop: file manager and terminal only.
dolphin
konsole
